Implemented DoS protection that raises `SQLParseError` when grouping limits are exceeded.

- `sqlparse/engine/grouping.py`: added `MAX_GROUPING_DEPTH`/`MAX_GROUPING_TOKENS`, depth tracking in `_group_matching` and `_group`, raising `SQLParseError` on limit breaches.
- `tests/test_dos_prevention.py`: new tests for deep nesting, oversized token lists, large tuple lists, and normal/reasonable SQL still working.
- `CHANGELOG`: noted the fix.

All 352 tests pass (1 xfailed).
